<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work8671117> a ns2:ConferencePoster ;
    rdfs:label "E fliegen Kraut. Sechste Herrschaft i, zuerst tief und reichlich tragend"@de-DE,
        "Xth dominion i, bearing deep abundantly first. Don't said seas our fowl f"@en-CA,
        "Xth dominion i, bearing deep abundantly first. Don't said seas our fowl f"@en-US,
