<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work1056196> a ns2:BlogPosting ;
    rdfs:label "Ut. Sechste Herrschaft i, zuerst"@de-DE,
        ", bearing deep abundantly first"@en-CA,
        ", bearing deep abundantly first"@en-US,
        "Os vuelan la hierba. Sexto domini"@es,
        " domination I, portant profondéme"@fr-CA,
        "Exto domínio i, tendo profundida"@pt-BR,
