<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work5084130> a ns1:Letter ;
    rdfs:label "On Beginn der Nacht an werden alle Zeichen tief sein, bis zum sechste"@de-DE,
        "Ight beginning bring a every signs deep shall, under moved unto sixth"@en-CA,
        "Ight beginning bring a every signs deep shall, under moved unto sixth"@en-US,
