<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work6137749> a ns4:ERO_0000071 ;
    rdfs:label "Ott hat den ganzen Himmel versammelt, von Anfang an i"@de-DE,
        "Bove. One first very you'll living, multiply rule. Sa"@en-CA,
