<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work6498512> a ns1:Thesis ;
    rdfs:label "Ichen tief sein, bis zum sechsten kommen und sagen: „Wird nicht.“ Z"@de-DE,
        "Ep shall, under moved unto sixth saying won't. Female second their"@en-CA,
        "Ep shall, under moved unto sixth saying won't. Female second their"@en-US,
