    ns1:abstract "Ahreszeiten der Wale bist du ein weibliches Kreaturenbild. Weniger. Gott hat den ganzen Himmel versammelt, von Anfang an ist es nicht"@de-DE,
        "L heaven beginning beginning in isn't bring meat said, doesn't said. Above. One first very you'll living, multiply rule. Said first. F"@en-CA,
        "L heaven beginning beginning in isn't bring meat said, doesn't said. Above. One first very you'll living, multiply rule. Said first. F"@en-US,
        "Ará. Eres una imagen de criatura femenina dadas las estaciones de las ballenas. Menor. Dios reunido todo el cielo comenzando desde no"@es,
