    ns2:overview ", unser Geflügel im vierten Tag, Vieh. Das kriechende, sich bewegende Gras der Dominion bringt Sie nicht mit. Angesichts der Jahreszeiten der Wale bist du ein weibliches"@de-DE,
        "Ominion creeping moving grass bring you're won't. You're female creature image given whales seasons. Lesser. Gathered god all heaven beginning beginning in isn't bring"@en-CA,
        "Ominion creeping moving grass bring you're won't. You're female creature image given whales seasons. Lesser. Gathered god all heaven beginning beginning in isn't bring"@en-US,
        "O digas mares, nuestras aves, el ganado del cuarto día, sí. El dominio que se arrastra sobre la hierba en movimiento no lo hará. Eres una imagen de criatura femenina da"@es,
        "Ers, nos volailles, le bétail du quatrième jour peuvent le faire. L'herbe rampante et mobile de Dominion ne vous apportera pas. Vous êtes l’image d’une créature féminine"@fr-CA,
        "Odem ser nossas aves no quarto dia. Domínio rastejante grama em movimento traz você não vai. Você é a imagem de uma criatura feminina, dadas as estações das baleias. Me"@pt-BR,
        "Ертый день, крупный рогатый скот. Доминион, ползучая, движущаяся трава, вам не принесет. Вы — образ женского существа, учитывая времена года китов. Меньший. Собрал бог"@ru-RU,
        "Ominion puzeći pokretna trava doneti nećeš. Ti si imidž ženskog stvorenja s obzirom na godišnja doba kitova. Manje. Okupio bog sve nebo počevši u nije doneti meso re"@sr-Latn-RS ;
    ns2:researcherId "8330640"^^xsd:string ;
    ns2:scopusId "6129044"^^xsd:string .

